{
  "type": "function",
  "function": {
    "name": "search_documents",
    "description": "**用途与调用规则**\n\n- 检索当前工作区已发布、当前可阅的制度知识、历史产物或外部资料。\n- query 可用作者原词、文号、实体和同义词，kind 分别为 knowledge、history、external。\n- 查过去的活动或政策时，businessDate 填业务发生日。\n- 系统另按资料封版时点过滤可见版本。\n- historical=true 时必须给出 businessDate；不确定资料类别时可省略 kind。\n- 最多返回前三段线索与 ref，核实条款或报价前须读取原段。",
    "parameters": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "query": {
          "maxLength": 256,
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Query",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "kind": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "enum": ["knowledge", "history", "external"],
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Kind"
        },
        "entity": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "maxLength": 240,
              "minLength": 1,
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Entity"
        },
        "businessDate": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "format": "date",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Businessdate"
        },
        "historical": {
          "default": false,
          "title": "Historical",
          "type": "boolean"
        }
      },
      "required": ["query"],
      "title": "Input",
      "type": "object"
    }
  },
  "examples": []
}
